[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Out of the Limelight]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:11.18]Why was their disguise 'too perfect' ? | 为什么他们的伪装“过于完美”？
[00:16.66]An ancient bus stopped by a dry river bed and a party of famous actors and actresses got off. | 一辆古旧的汽车停在一条干涸的河床旁，一群著名男女演员下了车。
[00:25.63]Dressed in dark glasses and old clothes, | 他们戴着墨镜，穿着旧衣裳，
[00:29.28]they had taken special precautions so that no one should recognize them. | 特别小心谨慎，以防别人认出他们。
[00:35.84]But as they soon discovered, disguises can sometimes be too perfect. | 但他们很快发现，伪装有时可能过于完美了。
[00:43.83]'This is a wonderful place for a picnic,' said Gloria Gleam. | “这是野餐的好地方，”格洛利亚·格利姆说。
[00:49.62]'It couldn't be better, Gloria,' Brinksley Meers agreed. | “再好不过了，格洛利亚，”布林克斯利·米尔斯表示同意，
[00:55.04]'No newspaper men, no film fans! Why don't we come more often?' | “没有记者，没有影迷！我们为什么不常来呢？”
[01:02.18]Meanwhile, two other actors Rockwall Slinger and Merlin Greeves, | 与此同时，另外两位演员罗克沃尔·斯林格和默林·格里夫斯，
[01:09.49]had carried two large food baskets to a shady spot under some trees. | 已把两个装满食品的大篮子提到了树荫下。
[01:16.70]When they had all made themselves comfortable, a stranger appeared. | 当他们都安顿好之后，一个陌生人出现了。
[01:22.56]He looked very angry. | 他看上去非常生气。
[01:25.96]'Now you get out of here, all of you!' he shouted. | “你们全都给我滚出去！”他喊道，
[01:31.29]'I'm sheriff here. Do you see that notice? It says "No Camping"  -- in case you can't read!' | “我是这里的司法长官。看到那个牌子了吗？上面写着‘禁止野营’——除非你们不识字！”
[01:43.12]'Look, sheriff,' said Rockwall, | “听着，长官，”罗克沃尔说，
[01:46.54]'don't be too hard on us. I'm Rockwall Slinger and this is Merlin Greeves.' | “别对我们太严厉。我是罗克沃尔·斯林格，这位是默林·格里夫斯。”
[01:55.69]'Oh, is it?' said the sheriff with a sneer. | “哦，是吗？”司法长官冷笑着说，
[02:00.11]'Well, I'm Brinksley Meers, and my other name is Gloria Gleam. Now you get out of here fast!' | “好啊，我就是布林克斯利·米尔斯，我的另一个名字叫格洛利亚·格利姆。现在你们赶快滚吧！”
